<!--
    Default distribution rules mapping the SNC base chart accounts (l10n_pt
    template plus the PT+ additions) to the cash flow categories, from the
    account/rubric relationship model provided and validated by the
    accounting department.
    Rules are shared across companies and scoped per chart of accounts (SNC
    Base or SNC Microentidades; rules whose mapping coincides in both charts
    carry no chart and apply to any). The sequences order the sets (shared
    100, SNC Base 110, SNC Microentidades 120) and sit above the default
    sequence 10 so that user-created rules win.
-->
